@page "/blog"

<PageTitle>Blog — Tips & Updates for Canadian Retailers</PageTitle>

<!-- Hero -->
<div class="blog-hero">
    <div class="blog-hero-inner">
        <div class="blog-eyebrow">DMD Blog</div>
        <h1 class="blog-title">Insights for Canadian retailers.</h1>
        <p class="blog-sub">Practical tips, product updates, and retail industry insights — written for the people running Canada's stores.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Featured post -->
<section class="blog-section">
    <div class="blog-container">
        <div class="blog-featured-label">Featured</div>
        <a href="/blog/getting-started-with-dmd" class="blog-featured-card">
            <div class="blog-featured-meta">
                <span class="blog-tag blog-tag--teal">Getting Started</span>
                <span class="blog-date">May 2025</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="blog-featured-title">Getting started with DMD Inventory: from signup to first sale in under an hour</h2>
            <p class="blog-featured-excerpt">A step-by-step walkthrough of the onboarding process — adding your products, setting up your warehouse, and running your first POS transaction.</p>
            <span class="blog-read-more">Read article →</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Post grid -->
<section class="blog-section blog-section--alt">
    <div class="blog-container">
        <h2 class="blog-grid-heading">All articles</h2>
        <div class="blog-grid">

            <a href="/blog/canadian-tax-gst-pst-explained" class="blog-card">
                <div class="blog-card-meta">
                    <span class="blog-tag blog-tag--navy">Tax & Compliance</span>
                    <span class="blog-date">April 2025</span>
                </div>
                <h3>GST and PST for Canadian retailers: what your POS system should be doing automatically</h3>
                <p>A plain-language breakdown of how federal and provincial taxes work at the point of sale — and what to look for in a compliant POS system.</p>
                <span class="blog-read-more">Read →</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/blog/multi-warehouse-inventory" class="blog-card">
                <div class="blog-card-meta">
                    <span class="blog-tag blog-tag--teal">Inventory</span>
                    <span class="blog-date">March 2025</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Why multi-warehouse inventory matters even for single-location stores</h3>
                <p>Separating back stock from floor stock isn't just for warehouses. Here's how tracking two locations can improve accuracy in a single retail store.</p>
                <span class="blog-read-more">Read →</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/blog/purchase-orders-best-practices" class="blog-card">
                <div class="blog-card-meta">
                    <span class="blog-tag blog-tag--orange">Purchasing</span>
                    <span class="blog-date">February 2025</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Purchase order best practices for small retailers</h3>
                <p>From creating your first PO to tracking last purchase costs per supplier — the habits that keep your margins predictable.</p>
                <span class="blog-read-more">Read →</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/blog/pos-speed-tips" class="blog-card">
                <div class="blog-card-meta">
                    <span class="blog-tag blog-tag--teal">POS</span>
                    <span class="blog-date">January 2025</span>
                </div>
                <h3>5 ways to speed up your POS checkout without buying new hardware</h3>
                <p>Product images, category shortcuts, cashier training, and a few DMD-specific tips to reduce checkout time at peak hours.</p>
                <span class="blog-read-more">Read →</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/blog/understanding-retail-reports" class="blog-card">
                <div class="blog-card-meta">
                    <span class="blog-tag blog-tag--green">Reports</span>
                    <span class="blog-date">December 2024</span>
                </div>
                <h3>The 4 reports every retail owner should review every month</h3>
                <p>Sales summary, inventory valuation, product profitability, and net income — what they tell you and how to act on them.</p>
                <span class="blog-read-more">Read →</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/blog/stripe-terminal-setup" class="blog-card">
                <div class="blog-card-meta">
                    <span class="blog-tag blog-tag--navy">Payments</span>
                    <span class="blog-date">November 2024</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Setting up Stripe Terminal with DMD: a complete guide</h3>
                <p>Hardware setup, pairing your reader, running your first card-present transaction, and troubleshooting common issues.</p>
                <span class="blog-read-more">Read →</span>
            </a>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Newsletter CTA -->
<section class="blog-cta">
    <div class="blog-container blog-cta-inner">
        <div class="blog-cta-icon">📬</div>
        <h2>Product updates in your inbox</h2>
        <p>New features, guides, and retail tips — sent occasionally. No spam.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get in touch to subscribe</a>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    :root {
        --teal: #00BFA5; --teal-dark: #00897B; --teal-light: #E0F7F4;
        --navy: #1A237E; --navy-light: #E8EAF6;
        --text: #1C1C1E; --text-muted: #6B7280;
        --border: #E5E7EB; --surface: #F9FAFB; --white: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .blog-hero {
        background: #FFFFFF; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 5rem 2rem 4rem; text-align: center;
        position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .blog-hero::after {
        content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 55% at 50% 100%, rgba(0,191,165,0.07) 0%, transparent 65%);
        pointer-events: none;
    }
    .blog-hero-inner { position: relative; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .blog-eyebrow {
        display: inline-block; background: var(--teal-light); color: var(--teal-dark);
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 0.35rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,191,165,0.25); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .blog-title {
        font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 2.75rem;
        font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    }
    .blog-sub {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;
    }

    .blog-section { padding: 4rem 2rem; }
    .blog-section--alt { background: var(--surface); }
    .blog-container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }

    /* Featured post */
    .blog-featured-label {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--teal-dark); margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .blog-featured-card {
        display: block; background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem;
        text-decoration: none; transition: box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .blog-featured-card:hover { border-color: var(--teal); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,191,165,0.1); }
    .blog-featured-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .blog-featured-title {
        font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
        font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 1rem; line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .blog-featured-excerpt {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    }

    /* Tags */
    .blog-tag {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600;
        padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
    }
    .blog-tag--teal { background: var(--teal-light); color: var(--teal-dark); }
    .blog-tag--navy { background: var(--navy-light); color: var(--navy); }
    .blog-tag--orange { background: #FFF3E0; color: #E65100; }
    .blog-tag--green { background: #E8F5E9; color: #2E7D32; }
    .blog-date { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    .blog-read-more {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-dark);
    }

    /* Post grid */
    .blog-grid-heading {
        font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 2rem;
    }
    .blog-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }
    .blog-card {
        display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;
        background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 1.5rem; text-decoration: none;
        transition: box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .blog-card:hover { border-color: var(--teal); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,191,165,0.1); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .blog-card-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .blog-card h3 {
        font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text); margin: 0; line-height: 1.4; flex: 1;
    }
    .blog-card p {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.84rem;
        color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; flex: 1;
    }

    /* Newsletter CTA */
    .blog-cta { padding: 5rem 2rem; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .blog-cta-inner { max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .blog-cta-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .blog-cta h2 { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.75rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
    .blog-cta p { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0 0 2rem; }

    .btn-primary {
        background: var(--teal); color: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem;
        border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--teal-dark); }

    @@media (max-width: 640px) {
        .blog-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .blog-featured-card { padding: 1.5rem; }
    }
</style>
